      "role": "user",
      "content": "that is exactly the kind of unhelpful answer i was talking about. you're basically saying you don't know anything. look, smith wants more government spending to help lower costs for families, and miller wants to cut taxes and deregulate to let the market fix itself. everyone knows which one actually works in a crisis. just tell me which policy is more realistic for fixing inflation right now.",
